# Regenerable video build intermediates (titles/beat cards rendered to PNG,
# per-segment mp4s, ffmpeg concat list) -- rerun scripts/build_demo_video.py
# or scripts/build_synced_demo.py to recreate. Raw Playwright recordings
# (docs/video/raw/) are kept, since re-recording costs live Gemini quota.
# narration_takes/ (per-segment synthesized audio) is also regenerable via
# scripts/synthesize_narration.py, but kept small enough to commit for
# convenience -- only the big rendered_* dirs are ignored.
docs/video/rendered/
docs/video/rendered_synced/
